I believe upstream:

```python
    @property
    def data_index(self) -> "DataIndex":
        from dvc_data.index import DataIndex

        if self._data_index is not None:
            return self._data_index
        if not self.config["feature"].get("data_index_cache"):
            return DataIndex()
```

Yes, upstream returns an empty in-memory DataIndex when the cache feature is disabled. Fix: return DataIndex() instead of None.

